BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:5th Annual Northern Nosh Jewish Food Festival
DTSTART:20261115T111500
DTEND:20261115T150000
DTSTAMP:20261115T175202Z
UID:9b70126b406df9ae8d7793e5906c50@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Sunday\, November 15\, for Vermont’s largest cele
 bration of Jewish food\, culture\, and community! Come hungry and enjoy an
  incredible selection of Jewish favorites\, including crispy latkes\, savo
 ry knishes\, matzo ball soup\, fresh falafel\, challah\, babka\, rugelach
 \, and so much more. Beyond the food\, enjoy a full afternoon of entertain
 ment for all ages\, featuring live klezmer music\, Yiddish dancing\, Music
  at the Blissful with Evan Haller\, PJ Library Story Time\, children's cra
 fts\, and a Bagel Taste Challenge featuring local bakeries! Everyone is we
 lcome! Whether you're Jewish\, curious about Jewish culture\, or simply lo
 ve great food\, the Northern Nosh is a wonderful opportunity to experience
  Jewish traditions and connect with the community. Hosted by Ohavi Zedek i
 n partnership with Jewish Communities of Vermont (JCVT). This event is mad
 e possible with generous support of the Harold Grinspoon Foundation.\n\nSo
 urces: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Ohavi Zedek Synagogue\, 188 North Prospect St
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/5th-annual
 -northern-nosh-jewish-food-festival-21-10-2026-14-31-54
END:VEVENT
