DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTSTAMP:20261115T175202Z
UID:7743ce98b939d6e822068ebef21d61@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Center for Solace Join us on Sunday\, November 15 at 4:00 PM a
 t the Latchis Theatre in for a stunning\, high-energy musical experience t
 hat bridges history and harmony. Enjoy a joyful\, soul-stirring...\n\nSour
 ces: Vermont.com
LOCATION:Center for Solace\, Brattleboro\, VT
URL:https://vermont.com/calendar/the-gospel-connection-with-suzanne-buell-
 benefit-concert/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Gospel Connection with Suzanne Buell: Benefit Concert for Cent
 er for Solace
DTSTART:20261115T160000
DTEND:20261115T235900
DTSTAMP:20261115T175202Z
UID:c8e8fff7bd9490fe04f29a45dfec75@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Led by dynamic vocalist Suzanne Buell\, The Gospel Connection 
 delivers a powerful journey through spirituals and gospel classics\, and t
 he deeply moving music that defined the Civil Rights movement. Far more th
 an a traditional concert\, the 6-piece band masterfully explores the music
 al lineage connecting historic gospel roots to contemporary pop\, soul\, a
 nd Americana artists. You will find yourself moving\, dancing\, and singin
 g along to vibrant arrangements of music popularized by legendary icons li
 ke Mavis Staples\, Aretha Franklin\, Sister Rosetta Tharpe\, Levon Helm\, 
 Paul Simon\, and more. This show will move your feet and lift your spirit.
  This special performance is the biggest fundraiser of the year for Center
  for Solace. Every ticket purchased directly supports our mission to offer
  services and support free of charge for serious illness\, hospice\, and g
 rief while engaging our community in conversations about mortality and lif
 e. Center for Solace is the only organization in Windham County providing 
 many support groups for people who have a serious illness\, are grieving t
 he loss of a loved one\, or are caregivers. Center for Solace also receive
 s no federal or state funding\, relying instead on donations\, sponsorship
 s\, and events like this one\, as well as proceeds from Experienced Goods 
 thrift store. sliding scale $35-$150+\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:The Latchis Theater\, 50 Main Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/the-gospel
 -connection-with-suzanne-buell-benefit-concert-for-center-for-solace-08-10
 -2026-14-59-49
END:VEVENT
